        "quote": "(a) Minor Plat Approval. The following plats or replats may be approved administratively upon the joint approval of the Planning Director and the Public Works Director without submission to or approval by the Planning Commission or City Council; provided, that all of the following criteria are met:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.35.010 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "17b3b882-7e14-581f-804d-775db6c9acb8",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 408,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:1",
          "start": 300
        },
        "quote": "(1) Right-of-way for new streets is not proposed or required to serve the lots or tracts in the subdivision;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.35.010 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "5b5c9fdf-cc66-5cc9-8d02-fc7234f011ea",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 515,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:2",
          "start": 409
        },
        "quote": "(2) The subdivision includes the total contiguous tract of land owned, or under control of, the applicant;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.35.010 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "e0c85065-10da-5a30-b400-c6b6005f08c6",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 602,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:3",
          "start": 516
        },
        "quote": "(3) The applicant has complied with any applicable stormwater management requirements;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.35.010 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "43c6d446-cb16-5b8b-b6c0-85e5b847dec0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 650,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:4",
          "start": 603
        },
        "quote": "(4) No more than five lots or tracts are added;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.35.010 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "137c4604-5877-5518-99f3-88b12ebf3d25",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 880,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:5",
          "start": 651
        },
        "quote": "(5) Except as provided in subsection (a)(1) of this section, dedication of right-of-way or easements for public purposes is allowed but no dedication of any ownership interest in land resulting in acquisition of fee simple title;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.35.010 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "5d2691c6-5202-5473-8e30-cd3b73bf8391",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1049,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:6",
          "start": 881
        },
        "quote": "(6) New lots or tracts front onto or are accessible from an existing street right-of-way which, except for nonbuildable lots or tracts, conforms to City specifications;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.35.010 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "a66ac962-6dbd-52f7-a754-5763c6d643ee",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1145,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:7",
          "start": 1050
        },
        "quote": "(7) Extensions of water or sewer mains are not required to serve the additional lots or tracts;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.35.010 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "e13943ea-cf00-5143-8dc9-47fa4d29eea3",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1396,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:8",
          "start": 1146
        },
        "quote": "(8) Easements for utilities are not vacated, altered, removed or realigned unless the utility consents in writing and the Planning Director determines that vacation will not adversely impact adjoining property owners or the public health and welfare;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.35.010:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
